	(text "J1962 male pigtail -> protected CCD receive daughterboard -> ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1 -> USB-C / local Wi-Fi AP" (at 30 46 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "3f806192-abec-4397-b86b-05d52b23a6ae")
	)
	(text "CARRIER PCB CONNECTIONS" (at 30 58 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.52 1.52) (thickness 0.23)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "46ebd16f-d824-4da6-9639-60a3187abec8")
	)
	(text "J1 is a 2x8 internal harness header: pad number equals J1962 contact number. Only contacts 3 and 11 are tentatively routed as CCD+ and CCD-." (at 30 64 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "56b35b85-cb7e-4eb3-92e5-500856126ef7")
	)
	(text "J2 receiver mezzanine: 1 CCD+ RAW, 2 CCD- RAW, 3 logic GND, 4 3V3, 5 RX_LOGIC, 6 RESERVED. J2 must include validated input protection and threshold/hysteresis." (at 30 72 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "e2a554f2-7eca-41ad-ae36-9660106fc087")
	)
	(text "J3/J4 are 1x22 sockets for the ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1 v1.1. J3-1 supplies 3V3, J3-4 is GPIO4/RX_LOGIC, J3-22 is GND; J4-1 is GND." (at 30 80 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "c07d7898-76b6-42f1-b395-bc126634a5a7")
	)
	(text "OPEN ITEMS - NOT FOR FABRICATION OR VEHICLE CONNECTION" (at 30 96 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.52 1.52) (thickness 0.23)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "780ae956-5ffb-484d-9b89-7f0de883e6bb")
	)
	(text "Confirm Prowler DLC pin population. No pin-16 power input/regulator is implemented. Pin 5 signal ground is isolated from logic ground by default; JP1 is an optional open link." (at 30 103 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "0a5664f7-534c-44e7-8a61-757abf3c60c9")
	)
	(text "CCD front-end protection, loading, comparator reference, hysteresis and bus waveform are not validated. P0 remains receive-only; no bias, termination or transmitter is fitted." (at 30 111 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "c947d4fc-d13e-4f49-9e2c-d4aac7cd940e")
	)
	(text "Power the DevKitC through its USB-C connector for this layout study. Define and validate protected vehicle power before relying on standalone operation in the car." (at 30 119 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "c20ac72a-ab68-45ed-ab4a-c957e8272441")
	)
